        "TileImage": "$($repository 1d757c45-065c-4535-8a03-845e1f1699cd).Image",
        "Description": "I watched all cutscenes in successive order to come up with this lore:\r\rOmar Al-Ghazali, owner of the Sceptre, has been afraid of the One Percent Killings for a while now, and does not trust his security detail. Ironically, he has contacted you to, er, remove them, without risk of them leaking data, or anyone being suspicion of him.\r\rYou are free to utilize any method to kill them. However, the Shiekh requires that minimum damage is done to the building, or anyone else present.",
